# -*- mode: snippet -*-
# name: Verb — intestazione Bearer tramite auth-source
# key: g-verb-auth
# group: HTTP.Verb
# expand-env: ((yas-indent-line 'fixed))
# --
* ${1:API esempio} :verb:
template https://${2:api.example.org}
Authorization: Bearer {{(or (auth-source-pick-first-password :host "$2") (user-error "Manca la credenziale per $2"))}}
Accept: application/json

** ${3:Profilo}
get /${4:profile}
$0
